            "review_title": "Review at Sakura Yakiniku Pasteur",
            "review_text": "Regular booker\nLondon, United Kingdom8 contributions\n0\nWagyu, salad, pancakes-one not to miss.\nNov 2024 • Couples\nIf you love Japanese food, or even if you’ve never tried it before -you are in for a treat. Plenty of Wagyu beef /meat platter options for teppanyaki. We also had the salad cá hoi tuoi which was really refreshing. The Korean pancakes were a revelation-never tried those before and loved them. It’s a shame we only discovered this restaurant on our last night in Saigon as we would have loved to eat here again.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten November 30, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
